{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656","id":5432234739,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABQ8lS8w","number":656,"title":"Potassium dibasic phosphate trihydrate has no record after the #624 rebuild","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-12T08:34:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:10:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found by the #624 rebuild in #653.\n\n`Potassium dibasic phosphate trihydrate` previously carried `CHEBI:131527` / CAS `7758-11-4`. The record behind that identifier is the **anhydrous** salt:\n\n```\ndata/ingredients/mapped/K2hpo4.yaml\n  identifier: CHEBI:131527\n  preferred_term: K2HPO4\n```\n\nSo a trihydrate was taking an anhydrous identity, which MAPPING_SEMANTICS §3 refuses. The rebuild drops the match and the row is now `UNMAPPED` — correct, but it leaves the substance with no record at all, where the sodium-glutamate case at least has one to route to.\n\n**Fix:** mint the trihydrate, per §3 — a form-specific ontology term if one exists, otherwise the registry pattern (`cas:` or `kgmicrobe.compound:`) with an asymmetric `skos:narrowMatch` to `CHEBI:131527` as the nearest parent, and both SSSOM rows per Rule B1.\n\nLikely belongs to the #459 hydrate cohort (199 hydrate records / 173 formula-as-label records, overlapping by 95) rather than being worked alone; filing it separately so the specific name is not lost inside that cohort.\n\nNot a blocker for #653.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01BP6MDZgidgzS79c75Ykhac","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}